      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>Rabbi Zalman Schachter-Shalomi’s translation of Psalms 29 was first published in <tei:hi rend="italic">Psalms in a Translation for Praying</tei:hi> (Alliance for Jewish Renewal, Philadelphia: 2014), p. 45.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>Reb Zalman was, in 2009, an early advocate of the Open Siddur Project and generously shared his liturgical and prayer work with the project following his vision of a common “Database Davvenen.” I have set his translation opposite the Masoretic Hebrew text of the psalm according to the phrasing he provided. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
